OL,3,GNorth East                             
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FClear   
OL,6,Fstart to Sunday, blustery showers      
OL,7,Fdeveloping later. Cloudy periods and   
OL,8,Fwindy on Monday, rain across the       
OL,9,FPennines. Grey and wet on Tuesday.     
OL,10,FTurning noticeably milder from Monday  
OL,11,Fonwards.                               
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
